      "sourceTextSha256": "0b67c527d1c1c38d66f64d23f10a352fa01ce516bd2179ac505874cb82cea492",
      "text": "Day 3 · After breakfast, congress in the morning.\n\nThen escape the bustle of the city on a tour to the Tigre Delta, with navigation in a private boat. Cruise through the lush landscapes of the Paraná Delta and its intricate waterways, passing picturesque islands and charming riverside homes. Explore the vibrant Tigre Market, where local artisans showcase their crafts and culinary delights, admire the elegant architecture of the Tigre Art Museum and enjoy the serene natural beauty of the delta.\n\nIn the evening, dinner at Piegari Carnes Italian Restaurant (Diamond menu), with transfers included.",
